; PkgManager over a root prepared for the upgrade scenario: the published
; soliton index as db/index.json and both archives in the cache, so the
; window never needs the network. Slowed transfers, automatic confirmation of
; the requester (--yes) and an event log, for a driven run.
Copy PAYLOAD:PKGMGR RAM:PkgManager
Copy PAYLOAD:APKG RAM:apkg
Copy PAYLOAD:PUTFILE RAM:putfile
Protect RAM:PkgManager +e
Protect RAM:apkg +e
Protect RAM:putfile +e
Delete SYS:PkgSol ALL FORCE QUIET
Delete RAM:gui-#? QUIET
MakeDir SYS:PkgSol
MakeDir SYS:PkgSol/db
MakeDir SYS:PkgSol/cache
Copy PAYLOAD:I/IDXS1 SYS:PkgSol/db/index.json
Copy PAYLOAD:I/IDXS2 RAM:idx-sol2.json
Copy PAYLOAD:A/SOLR1 SYS:PkgSol/cache/soliton.zip
Copy PAYLOAD:A/SOLR2 RAM:soliton-r2.zip
Run >NIL: RAM:PkgManager --root SYS:PkgSol --slow 300 --yes --log RAM:gui-events.log
